| **N2** | DISC | "In this paper we put focus on highlighting the novelty of our approach while leaving large-scale evaluation to future work." | Phỏng theo SE3-C2-019 (C10-crit tự nhiên) |
| **N3** | DISC | "We note that this is a limitation of the available data, rather than of our method." | Phỏng theo SE1-C9-014 |
