| **N6** | ABS | "To the best of our knowledge, we are the first to use contrastive pre-training for low-resource text classification." | Phỏng theo CR0060 (C2 phổ biến) |
| **K1** | DISC | "In interpreting our results, readers should bear in mind that the evaluation uses a single small dataset." | Phỏng theo D15 — đối chứng thận trọng |
